{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Rotting Man | \u60aa\u81ed\u7537 is a psychological horror game that depicts a protagonist working as a clerk in a Japanese internet caf\u00e9.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, having entered university, begins working part-time at an internet caf\u00e9. <br>However, as they carry out their duties, strange and inexplicable events gradually begin to occur...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A horror game set in Japan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work as a clerk at an internet caf\u00e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conversations with various characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person walking simulator</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since this is a demo version, it can be completed in about 10 minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Developer's Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed entirely by a 16-year-old solo developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Video Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Video uploads and live streaming are allowed without permission, regardless of individual or corporate use. <br>If possible, we would appreciate it if you could include a link to the Steam page in your video description. <br>RAYBIS GAMES takes no responsibility for any damages resulting from the posting or streaming of gameplay videos. <br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809290?t=1750373916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3809290?t=1750373916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809290/a58b8189dd1ecdbf1a5153c9827d3c44b38c9ee8/capsule